Monitor vehicles and stationary assets with IoT Solution Online. The app allows:
- managing the working list of units being tracked: data on movement and ignition status, information relevance, and units location is always at hand on a real time basis;
- working with the map: access to units, geofences, tracks, and event markers as well as defining your own location on the map is no longer an issue;
- working in a monitoring mode: tracking the location and parameters of each and every unit has never been easier;
- controlling events: their duration, chronology, and number as well well as the data on trips, stops, fillings, thefts, and sensors values are available at any time;
- receiving and viewing notifications on the screen of the mobile device;
- creating and sharing links to the vehicles current location;
- sending commands for remote setup.

Speedometer lets you determine the exact speed of all types of transport. The app shows the current, average and maximum speed, and tracks the distance traveled. For usability purposes, the app features a projection display mode and displays your current location on the map.

Both miles per hour (mph) and kilometers per hour (km/h) are supported as speed measurement units.

The app uses your phone’s GPS to accurately determine your speed. Therefore, access to your location is required for proper operation.

Key features:
• Determine the current, average and maximum speed in imperial/metric measurement units;
• Measure the distance traveled;
• Track location on a map;
• Calculate the acceleration time;
• Windscreen projection display mode;
• Speed limit control mode. Visual and sound effects will warn you if the established speed limit is exceeded;
• Simple user interface.

